  "difficulty_reason": "The objects need only be finite type, so ordinary finitely presented object descent does not apply. The proof passes through prescribed scheme-theoretic-image models, factors finite-stage maps using schematic density, then turns constructible eventual containment of an equalizer into scheme-theoretic equality. This non-finite-presentation categorical Noetherian approximation mechanism is substantially beyond coefficient descent.",
